From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: John Ericson <John.Ericson@Obsidian.Systems>
Date: Tue, 18 Aug 2026 02:21:00 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] tools/libcompat: gather <sys/secflags.h> and <sys/procset.h>

`cmd/sgs/include/conv.h` includes <sys/secflags.h>, which includes
<sys/procset.h>. Both are illumos-only; glibc has no counterpart.

Assisted-By: Claude Opus 5 (claude-opus-5)
---
 usr/src/tools/libcompat/Makefile | 4 +++-
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/usr/src/tools/libcompat/Makefile b/usr/src/tools/libcompat/Makefile
index 030881591b..bd2a760068 100644
--- a/usr/src/tools/libcompat/Makefile
+++ b/usr/src/tools/libcompat/Makefile
@@ -80,7 +80,9 @@ SYSHDRS=	sys/elf.h \
 		sys/avl.h \
 		sys/avl_impl.h \
 		sys/link.h \
-		sys/machelf.h
+		sys/machelf.h \
+		sys/secflags.h \
+		sys/procset.h
 
 #
 # <sys/machtypes.h> is per-ISA; everything above is machine-independent.  The
